*******************************************************************************************
* INPUT                                                                                   *
*******************************************************************************************
1                              :: Model file format: Voronoi (=1), vtx 2D (=2), vtx 3D (=3)
model.vtx                      :: Model file
../electrodes.dat              :: Electrodes file
*******************************************************************************************
* OUTPUT                                                                                  *
*******************************************************************************************
10                             :: Grid dicing
grid.z                         :: GMT output file for slice
bound.gmt                      :: GMT plotting bounds for slice
1                              :: Plot electrodes?
electrodes.dat                 :: Electrodes file compatible with GMT
*******************************************************************************************
* 2D SLICE OPTIONS (only used if the file is Voronoi or vtx 3D)                           *
*******************************************************************************************
1                              :: Plot xy plane (=0), xz plane (=1), yz plane (=2)
0                              :: Value of z if xy plane, y if xz plane, x if yz plane
*******************************************************************************************
* VORONOI MODEL OPTIONS (only used if the file is Voronoi)                                *
*******************************************************************************************
-50   50                       :: Minimum and maximum x
0   0                          :: Minimum and maximum y
0   30                         :: Minimum and maximum z
201   1   61                   :: Number of pixels in [x y z]
*******************************************************************************************